<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The 3.5mm input jack on the PCB can be soldered directly to the three audio signal wires of the&nbsp;Sony MDR-7508 headphones and placed inside the left headphone&nbsp;after drilling the required holes for the on/off switch, the micro-USB charging port and the 3.5mm audio input port which continues to work&nbsp;just like before the modifications:</p>


